         "tag": "p",
         "attrs": {
          "class": "paragraph_style_1"
         },
         "c": [
          {
           "tag": "#text",
           "v": "Highlights of the trip included glacier hikes on Perito Moreno and Viedma glaciers, sightings of Chilean condors and pumas, and inspiring views of the “towers” of Torres del Paine. "
